#!/usr/bin/env bash

set -euo pipefail

cat <<'INSTRUCTIONS'

Implement the request and commit.

Create 3 distinct prompts for read-only adversarial reviews written out to temp files:
`h-review-3 '<prompt 1>' '<prompt 2>' '<prompt 3>'`
No timeout: it waits for all reviews. Read/delete each review; assess feedback, don't apply
it blindly.

Substantive: bugs, behavior, security, data integrity, compatibility, material performance,
failed tests, unmet acceptance criteria. Minor: docs/comments, style, naming, formatting,
optional refactors, behavior-neutral cleanup.

No substantive findings: make no changes; rebase `main`. If no-op/no conflicts, run
`notify-done-sound` and stop. Any substantive finding (including mixed), or rebase failure:
run `h-feedback <PROMPT ON WHAT TO DO>`; delegate the fix, don't make it here.
INSTRUCTIONS
